class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fish_332645.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cherry\"><img alt=\"Cherry\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cherry_4219e7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Edron goblin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"85\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Edron_goblin_f62894.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.4<br/>November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThis is the cave you will find in the southern part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Troll-Goblin%20Peninsula\">Edron Troll-Goblin Peninsula</a>. It is inhabited by goblins, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\">bugs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Wasp\">wasps</a>. The goblins that live there cultivate <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">mushrooms</a> in some muddy fields. Oddly enough, many piles of bones of <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">trolls</a> are found in one of the caves. Possibly, trolls had inhabited there before and were killed by the goblins. There is also a little <a href=\"#/quest/edron-goblin-quest\">quest</a> in this cave. <br/>\nIt is a quite good start hunting place or if you got bored from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Troll%20Cave\">trolls</a> in the north. Good for <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, because they can skill with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stones</a>  dropped by goblins.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First level creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\"><img alt=\"Goblin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_be448b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblin</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">25</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">50</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">35 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-9× <a href=\"#/wiki